#ASSERT `the two numbers agree to a cent` (`the real appreciation` (`sale eight`)) 594_000
#ASSERT `the loss on the sale` (`sale eight`) EQUALS 0

-- Real interest of 20,000 at divisor 110: remaining 2,020,000; adjusted 2,400,000 + 20,000 x 120/110 = 2,421,818.18; inflationary 401,818.18; appreciation 980,000; real 578,181.82.
