§§ `Sections 49 to 49F: the residential exemptions`

-- THE ONLY-DWELLING EXEMPTION, s 49B(2), with the default facts: a qualifying dwelling (100 of 100 months), asked, resident, all rights sold, owned 24 months, no other dwelling, no earlier exempt sale, sold on 1 March 2025 for 3,000,000 (ceiling 5,008,000).
-- The ordinary case: all of the sale value is exempt.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 3_000_000
-- Not asked on the declaration under s 73: no exemption (s 49A(a)).
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
-- Neither a resident nor a non-resident with no dwelling where resident: no exemption.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
-- A non-resident with no dwelling in the country where they are resident is entitled.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 3_000_000
-- Only some of the rights sold: s 49A(a) needs all of them.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
-- Qualifying: 80 of 100 months is four fifths exactly (80 x 5 = 400 >= 100 x 4); 79 is not, unless the four-year period is met.
-- 80 of 100 months: a qualifying dwelling.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 80 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 3_000_000
-- 79 of 100 months: not qualifying.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 79 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
-- 79 of 100 months but served as a dwelling through all four years before the sale: qualifying by the second period.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 79 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) TRUE)) 3_000_000
-- Owner for 18 months from the day it became a dwelling.
-- 17 months: too short.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 17 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
-- 18 months: enough.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 18 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 3_000_000
-- No sale free of tax of another dwelling under the paragraph in the 18 months before (fork F5: exactly 18 months back is allowed).
-- Sold another 17 months back: barred.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (JUST 17) FALSE)) 0
-- Sold another 18 months back: not within the 18 months preceding (fork F5).
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (JUST 18) FALSE)) 3_000_000
-- Sold another 40 months back: allowed.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (JUST 40) FALSE)) 3_000_000
-- THE CEILING of s 49A(a1): 5,008,000 from 1 January 2025 to 31 December 2027, read from the official page.
-- Sale value equal to the ceiling: all exempt.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 5_008_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 5_008_000
-- One shekel above: the exemption stops at the ceiling.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 5_008_001 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 5_008_000
-- 6,000,000: exempt 5,008,000.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 6_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 5_008_000
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the fraction of the sale that stays taxable` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 6_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0.165333
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the fraction of the sale that stays taxable` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the fraction of the sale that stays taxable` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2025) 3_000_000 100 FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 1
-- 31 December 2024: the ceiling for the earlier year is not held: NOTHING, never the 2025 figure.
#ASSERT `the answer is missing` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 31 12 2024) 6_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE))
-- 1 January 2025: the first day of the 2025 amount.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 1 2025) 6_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 5_008_000
-- 31 December 2027: the last day (s 49A(a1): no update in tax years 2025 to 2027).
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 31 12 2027) 6_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 5_008_000
-- 1 January 2028: the update that begins in 2028 is not held: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `the answer is missing` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 1 2028) 6_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE))
-- No figure is needed when the conditions fail: 0 even for a day whose ceiling is not held.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 1 2020) 3_000_000 100 FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE (`no other dwellings`) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
-- OTHER DWELLINGS, ss 49B(2), 49C and 49D. Fields of `a dwelling`: holder, share, through an association, inherited, protected tenancy, in Israel or the Area, bought as a replacement, inherited on the conditions of 49B(5).
-- Another dwelling wholly yours, in Israel: your dwelling is not your only one.
