-- Bought on 1 March 2024 (inside the window, so 18 months), sold 1 March 2026: 24 months, outside; under the old 24 months it would have been inside.
#ASSERT `the answer is the number` (`the sale value that is exempt` (`an exemption sale` (Date 1 3 2026) 3_000_000 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (LIST (`a dwelling` `you` (1) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE (JUST (Date 1 3 2024)) FALSE)) 24 (NOTHING) FALSE)) 0
-- Bought on 1 March 2025 (inside the window, so 18 months), sold 1 March 2027: 24 months, outside: it stands against you.
